                <description><![CDATA[<article>
				<blockquote class="messageText SelectQuoteContainer ugc baseHtml">
					
					"<b>If It Isn't With You</b>" is a song by Bruneian recording artist Eqah. It is her debut single. The song is about longing for someone after a break-up. It is a dance track and uses the metaphor of being alone on the dance floor and longing for someone to dance with.<br>
<br>
<b><i>The song was released to <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brunei" target="_blank" class="externalLink" rel="nofollow">Brunei</a> radio stations in July 2010 and iTunes in August 2010.<br>
</i></b><br>
